WEBVTT

00:05:59.876 --> 00:06:04.676
we've trained more than 1,500
of these judges.

00:06:04.716 --> 00:06:10.476
(Applause)

00:06:11.316 --> 00:06:14.636
About a year after we started
training the judges,

00:06:14.676 --> 00:06:17.276
a prosecutor came to our office and said,

00:06:17.316 --> 00:06:20.276
"In that law that you helped write,

00:06:20.316 --> 00:06:24.476
we, the prosecutors, got the right to sue
the Chinese government

00:06:24.476 --> 00:06:27.956
on behalf of the people,
for environmental matters,

00:06:27.996 --> 00:06:30.996
and we've never had the right
to sue the government before."